{"3371140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warmongers", "steam_appid": 3371140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown god has taken upon itself to plunder worlds and dimensions in search of creatures it could add to its twisted game. A barely noticeable piece of the souls of these Warmongers was harvested to be forged into cards, allowing the divine rulers to play a new form of games with mortals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, new and more powerful beings were added. Some, not even mortal. Demons, Dragons, and all other sorts of dangerous creatures. Today, the Game was leaked to the mortal realms, and is now threatening the precarious balance of power, for the game's rules are now enforcing their will upon the magic of the universe itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The players can now engage in matches, allowing them to gather soul dust and use it to purchase more cards. Climb the ranks to claim the highest position possible and unlock rewards—skins, sleeves, maps—some of them unique</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own, unique deck out of 1000 cards with unique effect. Some are magics, that buff your own cards, some can Exile, damage or resurrect Creatures. Others can be equipped like armour or weapons, and have intricate effects like redirecting an Attack or Fireblast toward another Creature with realistic visual effect, not just moving numbers around! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invoke Powerful Creatures on the field and have a real 3D Creature appear to fight for you! Protect your Invoker or lose the game when it's life points reach 0!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371140/extras/77c441a03d8178b1e600b8ed8f1f5a6d.avif?t=1762024788\" 